a(f"The proposed design needs 11.27~MVA; with coupling transformers and a 100~Hz filter added to the cost, its annual objective under the assumed exceedance penalty is {r0(x['dJ_min'])}\\% lower than for corrected percentile sizing in {'every' if pw['pct_min_J']['weeks_lower']==60 else str(pw['pct_min_J']['weeks_lower'])+' of 60'} simulated week{'' if pw['pct_min_J']['weeks_lower']==60 else 's'} ({r0(x['dJ_opt'])}\\% lower than with its rating optimised). Capital, hardware and losses are {lh(x['dCLs_min'])} than for the percentile design at its minimum rating and {lh(x['dCLs_opt'])} than with its rating optimised, the saving being mainly exceedance ({r0(x['dEv_min'])}\\% lower); at equal exceedance the proposed family needs {r0(x['eq1']['pct'])}--{r0(x['eq2']['pct'])}\\% less capital, hardware and losses.")
